Install-Package Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore → main ORM
Install-Package Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore.SqlServer → SQL Server support ke liye
Install-Package Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore.Tools → migration commands ke liye

Check .csproj for these lines:
<ItemGroup>
  <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore" Version="7.0.0" />
  <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore.SqlServer" Version="7.0.0" />
  <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore.Tools" Version="7.0.0">
    <PrivateAssets>all</PrivateAssets>
    <IncludeAssets>runtime; build; native; contentfiles; analyzers; buildtransitive</IncludeAssets>
  </PackageReference>
</ItemGroup>

